I see exactly what happened!
When you pasted the code from the last step, you accidentally pasted the **New Vertical Timeline** inside the <Dialog open={isModalOpen}> (which is the small Accept/Reject popup) instead of the <Dialog open={isViewModalOpen}> (which is the large Eye Icon popup).
Because of this mix-up, the Eye Icon was still showing the old, horizontal stepper with "Role ID", and the time calculations got buried in the action dialog.
Let's fix this completely. I will give you the exact code to replace BOTH dialogs so everything goes to its proper place.
### The Fix: Replace Both Dialogs
Scroll down to where your Dialogs start (around line 614, right below sx={styles.dataGridContainer} />).
**DELETE everything from  {/* --- Main Grid Approve/Reject Dialog --- */} down to the very end of the file, and replace it with this:**
